model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input dom: int

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to world amount amt

version base
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN "own"
  dom = 1 "own"
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask b: bal(konto, 2027-01-31) in late
